  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Digital, Inclusive and Accessible  (DIA) Service Provision 2023-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital, Inclusive and Accessible (DIA) Service Provision 2023-2027 - Digital, Inclusive and Accessible (DIA) Service Provision</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">DIA-projektet syftar till att forts&#xe4;tta st&#xf6;dja den p&#xe5;g&#xe5;ende digitaliseringsprocessen i Ukraina i syfte att st&#xe4;rka regeringens kapacitet att leverera h&#xf6;gkvalitativa och tillg&#xe4;ngliga digitala tj&#xe4;nster till utsatta grupper i Ukraina samtidigt som digital teknik och l&#xf6;sningar anv&#xe4;nds f&#xf6;r att m&#xf6;ta andra komplexa utmaningar som kriget medf&#xf6;r. inklusive att s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla &#xf6;ppenhet och ansvarsskyldighet f&#xf6;r &#xe5;terh&#xe4;mtningsprocessen, vilket &#xe4;r avg&#xf6;rande f&#xf6;r Ukrainas EU-integration.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The DIA Project aims to continue supporting the ongoing digitalisation process in Ukraine with the view of strengthening the Government&#x2019;s capacities to deliver high quality and accessible digital services to vulnerable groups in Ukraine while using digital technologies and solutions to address other complex challenges posed by the war, including ensuring transparency and accountability of the recovery process, critically important for Ukraine&#x2019;s EU Integration.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the intervention are as follows:

-To strengthen capacity of the Government institutions to design and implement inclusive digital transformation policy at the national and local levels;
-To equip the Government with a digital infrastructure that ensures efficient and effective processes for the civil service and delivery of technically modernized digital public services for vulnerable and war-affected groups; 
-To increase the digital skills of Ukrainian women and men to fully benefit from digitalization.</narrative>
  </description>
